Double-checking each Case 1 count: s=4 → 1, s=9 → 4, s=16 → 7, s=25 → 12, s=36 → 17, s=49 → 24 (all valid since b = s−a ≤ 48 ≤ 60). Case 2: s=64 → b ∈ [33,60] gives 28; s=81 → b ∈ [41,60] gives 20; s=100 → b ∈ [51,60] gives 10. All correct.

